{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_099_med_flamingo-title\">Med-Flamingo</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">区别于单一投影接 LLM，Med-Flamingo 用 Perceiver 固定视觉 latent，并在多层冻结 LLM 中反复注入门控跨注意力。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Compresses variable-number medical images via a Perceiver Resampler and injects them into a frozen LLM through tanh-gated cross-attention layers for few-shot in-context learning.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">交错的医学图像、文本及若干上下文示例</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Interleaved sequence of exemplar medical images, clinical text, and a query medical image/question</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">条件于图像和 in-context 示例的自回归医学回答或解释</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Autoregressive medical VQA answer or clinical rationale conditioned on in-context exemplars</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v225/moor23a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Med-Flamingo original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/b4b3c31597ad9174720f.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_099_med_flamingo\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_099_med_flamingo\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">交错图文上下文</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">支持一张或多张图像与示例问答顺序混排</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests interleaved sequence of exemplar medical images, clinical text, and a query medical image/question and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"支持一张或多张图像与示例问答顺序混排\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests interleaved sequence of exemplar medical images, clinical text, and a query medical image/question and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"交错图文上下文\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">交错图文上下文</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">支持一张或多张图像与示例问答顺序混排</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests interleaved sequence of exemplar medical images, clinical text, and a query medical image/question and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预训练视觉 encoder；Flamingo 训练中保持冻结\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes CLIP ViT-L/14 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"CLIP ViT-L/14\" data-node-name-en=\"CLIP ViT-L/14\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CLIP ViT-L/14</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预训练视觉 encoder；Flamingo 训练中保持冻结</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes CLIP ViT-L/14 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把可变数量视觉特征压成固定数量 latent token\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Perceiver Resampler within the core perceiver gated cross attention vlm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Perceiver Resampler\" data-node-name-en=\"Perceiver Resampler\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Perceiver Resampler</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把可变数量视觉特征压成固定数量 latent token</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Perceiver Resampler within the core perceiver gated cross attention vlm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"医学提示、示例和待答问题进入冻结语言主干\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs LLaMA-7B token within the core perceiver gated cross attention vlm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"LLaMA-7B 文本 token\" data-node-name-en=\"LLaMA-7B token\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">LLaMA-7B 文本 token</span><span class=\"lang-en\">LLaMA-7B token</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">医学提示、示例和待答问题进入冻结语言主干</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs LLaMA-7B token within the core perceiver gated cross attention vlm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"插入语言层之间，门控地读取最近图像 latent\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Gated cross-attention layers within the core perceiver gated cross attention vlm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Gated cross-attention layers\" data-node-name-en=\"Gated cross-attention layers\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Gated cross-attention layers</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">插入语言层之间，门控地读取最近图像 latent</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Gated cross-attention layers within the core perceiver gated cross attention vlm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"保留通用生成能力，主要训练连接模块\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs LLaMA language model within the core perceiver gated cross attention vlm computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"冻结 LLaMA language model\" data-node-name-en=\"LLaMA language model\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">冻结 LLaMA language model</span><span class=\"lang-en\">LLaMA language model</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">保留通用生成能力，主要训练连接模块</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs LLaMA language model within the core perceiver gated cross attention vlm computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"PMC-OA 与医学教材图文数据更新 resampler/cross-attention\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies pretraining to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"医学持续预训练\" data-node-name-en=\"pretraining\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">医学持续预训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">pretraining</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">PMC-OA 与医学教材图文数据更新 resampler/cross-attention</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies pretraining to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按 next-token 概率生成回答或 rationale\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces autoregressive medical vqa answer or clinical rationale conditioned on in-context exemplars via Few-shot.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Few-shot 生成\" data-node-name-en=\"Few-shot\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_099_med_flamingo', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Few-shot 生成</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Few-shot</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按 next-token 概率生成回答或 rationale</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces autoregressive medical vqa answer or clinical rationale conditioned on in-context exemplars via Few-shot.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Med-Flamingo Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 交错门控跨注意力注入多图上下文</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Tanh-Gated Cross-Attention Conditioning a Frozen LLM on Interleaved Medical Visual Latents</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Med-Flamingo：核心公式 · 交错门控跨注意力注入多图上下文\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"99\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"21.339504pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.463972 -69.011212 351.95489 21.339504\" width=\"351.95489pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs