" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"104.478582\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g16-37\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"111.322899\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"115.317913\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g16-26\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"121.753777\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g20-105\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"123.775595\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g20-109\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"129.433779\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g20-103\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"134.066387\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"138.190919\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g16-30\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"142.09428\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g7-20\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"147.192451\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g13-67\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"150.63601\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"154.451686\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"158.466619\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g4-1\" y=\"-66.410963\"></use><use x=\"163.842952\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"178.793498\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g16-63\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"184.671458\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"188.786023\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g16-72\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"193.588014\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"200.171022\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g1-61\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"209.27459\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g4-214\" y=\"-69.011212\"></use><use x=\"214.569738\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g13-67\" y=\"-47.7659\"></use><use x=\"225.161627\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g16-63\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"231.039586\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"235.154152\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g16-72\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"240.012436\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g13-67\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"246.621841\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g10-106\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"252.17871\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g16-72\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"257.153356\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g13-159\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"262.295175\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g13-67\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"265.738736\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"270.358027\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g16-17\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"275.538595\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g7-184\" y=\"-62.931518\"></use><use x=\"280.662174\" xlink:href=\"#m099_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">通用多模态模型医学知识不足，专用模型又难做少样本对话</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">General-purpose VLMs lacked medical domain knowledge, while task-specific medical models could not adapt on the fly from a few examples.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在冻结的语言模型中插入跨注意力层，接收交错医学图像与文本上下文</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Continue pretraining a Flamingo-style gated cross-attention architecture on interleaved biomedical textbook/article figures and text.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">基于 Flamingo 进行医学图文持续预训练并支持 in-context few-shot</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Perceiver Resampler fixed-token visual compression + zero-initialized tanh-gated cross-attention interleaved inside a frozen LLM.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于 few-shot 医学视觉问答与 rationale generation 原型</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Prototype for few-shot in-context medical visual question answering and clinical rationale generation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">早期医学 MLLM；评测规模小，语言先验可能掩盖视觉不足</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Early medical MLLM milestone; human evaluation cohorts were small and LLM priors can still generate plausible-sounding errors.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">Perceiver 将任意图像 token 压缩为固定视觉 latent，控制跨注意力成本。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">门控 cross-attention 插入冻结语言模型，使文本生成按交错图像条件化。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">通过医学图文持续预训练连接层，保留基础主干并获得 in-context few-shot 能力。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Continue pretraining a Flamingo-style gated cross-attention architecture on interleaved biomedical textbook/article figures and text.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Perceiver Resampler fixed-token visual compression + zero-initialized tanh-gated cross-attention interleaved inside a frozen LLM.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Tanh-Gated Cross-Attention Conditioning a Frozen LLM on Interleaved Medical Visual Latents.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">能用少量示例快速切换医学视觉问答格式，适合作为研究型原型。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">生成 rationale 不等于可验证推理；冻结主干仍可继承通用域偏差与幻觉，不能当作临床证据链。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Prototype for few-shot in-context medical visual question answering and clinical rationale generation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Early medical MLLM milestone; human evaluation cohorts were small and LLM priors can still generate plausible-sounding errors.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v225/moor23a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Med-Flamingo: a Multimodal Medical Few-shot Learner</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/snap-stanford/med-flamingo\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
